  "title": "Ricotta Gnudi",
  "description": "These homemade ricotta gnudi have more bite than traditional gnudi due to the addition of semolina flour.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-03-24T08:48:41-04:00",
